{
  "about": "Skill refusals (issue #361): a Mage with no SP left presses Sight on the hotkey bar; the server refuses it (0x0110, cause 1) and the chat says the game's \"Insufficient SP\" in red. /sf turns the optional failure lines off and on again with the game's own lines. Ends a Novice with no skills, full SP.",
